/E (Resisting AI also emerged as a strong theme, with 9% of responses referring to individual actions such as avoiding AI tools or being more critical of the content they consume. A further 14% of responses referenced collective action, and there was notable overlap between the themes of resistance and reimagination. For instance, some participants proposed the idea of community-owned AI as a form of collective resistance.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
