169 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (Education was the second most popular answer to how democracy could survive AI. The popularity of this idea varied significantly from state to state. Education was the second most popular theme in Perth \(25%\) and Adelaide \(22%\), closely following regulation. Within Melbourne, 14% of responses suggested education, making it the fourth most popular response. The East coast was far less supportive of education, with just 6% of responses supporting education in Brisbane and Sydney. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
