175 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 73 0 R
/E (20% of responses addressing collective action featured themes of local community action. These often focused on ideas of data sovereignty. Multiple responses referenced community-owned AI and internet, and taking back ownership of the data that models had trained on. Others believed that local communities should come together to resist AI. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
