179 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 73 0 R
/E (Lastly, 8% of collective action responses focused on how users of AI systems may come together to demand change. Ideas included only using ethical AIs and having the power to decide when they want to use AI. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
