/P 76 0 R
/E (However, this research reflects the views of self-selected, tech-engaged participants who chose to attend events focused on AI and democracy. While the insights generated here are valuable for understanding how informed audiences are thinking about these issues, they do not represent the views of the general public. Future research would focus on how broader populations, including those with less technological understanding, perceive the relationship between AI and democracy.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
